  "sayAs": {
    "_doc": "how Kokoro should SAY a word or phrase it reads wrongly (the text on screen is unchanged; tools/build_voice.py records the spoken form, the file name includes it, the STORY-VOICES ledger keeps it). Found by tools/story_voice_audit.py and the heteronym phoneme check. Comma-pause keys (e.g. \"looked down\" → \"looked, down\") make a lost ending or a swallowed short word clear; each key is widened until it matches only the line(s) it fixes.",
    "Mochi": "Moh-chee",
    "a tear in it": "a tare in it",
    "around the tear": "around the tare",
    "our hero read the last page": "our hero red the last page",
    "even read aloud": "even red aloud",
    "that read Listener Club": "that red Listener Club",
    "Bao likes strawberries": "Bao likes, strawberries",
    "Sprinkle likes strawberries": "Sprinkle likes, strawberries",
    "hero and Puffbun wave": "hero and, Puffbun wave",
